     "text": "FUNCTION_BLOCK ConveyorControl\nVAR_INPUT\n    sensor_a : BOOL;\n    sensor_b : BOOL;\nEND_VAR\nVAR_OUTPUT\n    conveyor : BOOL := FALSE;\nEND_VAR\nVAR\n    conveyor_latch : RS;\nEND_VAR\n\n(* Reset priority keeps the conveyor stopped while sensor B is active. *)\nconveyor_latch(S := sensor_a, R1 := sensor_b);\nconveyor := conveyor_latch.Q1;\n\nEND_FUNCTION_BLOCK\n\n\nPROGRAM Main\nVAR\n    SensorA AT %IX100.0 : BOOL;\n    SensorB AT %IX100.1 : BOOL;\n    Conveyor AT %QX100.0 : BOOL;\nEND_VAR\nVAR\n    controller : ConveyorControl;\nEND_VAR\n\ncontroller(\n    sensor_a := SensorA,\n    sensor_b := SensorB\n);\nConveyor := controller.conveyor;\n\nEND_PROGRAM",
